        <h2>ABOUT MAJID JORDAN</h2>

        <p>
            Majid Jordan is a Canadian R&B duo consisting
            of Majid Al Maskati and Jordan Ullman.
            Known for atmospheric production, distinctive
            vocals and a contemporary sound, the duo has
            established a unique presence in modern R&B.
        </p>

